WEBVTT

00:08:29.463 --> 00:08:33.425
(Applause)

00:08:33.425 --> 00:08:37.805
This idea that it takes too long
to build plants is confusing,

00:08:37.846 --> 00:08:41.517
considering we're going
to need energy forever.

00:08:42.476 --> 00:08:44.812
You know, the best time
to build nuclear plants

00:08:44.853 --> 00:08:47.022
was 10 years ago.

00:08:47.815 --> 00:08:50.109
The next best time is today.

00:08:51.694 --> 00:08:58.492
Now we’ve finally arrived at the most
fashionable objection at the moment:

00:08:59.702 --> 00:09:03.038
nuclear power is too expensive.